        <span class="section-tag">Specialized Solutions</span>
        <h2>Tailored Water Heater Services for New Sweden Residents</h2>
        <p>
          We align our service offerings with the specific infrastructure, fuel types, and mechanical room configurations common throughout New Sweden.
        </p>
        <div class="grid-2">
